---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Sinchi"
  description="Sinchi Terms of Service. Plain-English terms for our Google Business Profile and website optimization services for New Zealand businesses."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <div class="badge-pill">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Terms of Service</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 29 September 2026 · Governed by New Zealand Law</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-card card-surface">
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing <a href="https://sinchi.co.nz">sinchi.co.nz</a>, requesting a visibility audit, or engaging Sinchi for Google Business Profile optimization or website services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, please do not use our services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Services & Scope</h2>
          <p>
            Sinchi provides specialized local search engine optimization, Google Business Profile management, and website performance enhancements for businesses operating in New Zealand.
          </p>
          <p>
            The exact scope of deliverables, reporting frequencies, and fees will be specified in your written service quote or proposal.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. No Ranking Guarantees (Fair Trading Act 1986 Compliance)</h2>
          <p>
            In compliance with the <strong>Fair Trading Act 1986</strong> and Google's official Webmaster Guidelines, <strong>Sinchi does not guarantee a #1 ranking or specific map placement</strong> on Google Maps or any other search platform.
          </p>
          <p>
            Google search algorithms are proprietary and subject to continuous updates and external market competition. While we employ rigorous, best-practice optimization techniques to achieve maximum local visibility, final ranking determinations remain under the exclusive control of Google LLC.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. Client Responsibilities & Asset Access</h2>
          <p>To perform optimization services effectively, the Client agrees to:</p>
          <ul class="legal-list">
            <li>Grant Sinchi appropriate 'Manager' access to the relevant Google Business Profile (you will never be asked for your personal Google password).</li>
            <li>Provide accurate business information (Name, Address, Phone, services, areas served).</li>
            <li>Ensure that all provided images, logos, and written content do not infringe upon any third-party intellectual property rights.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Month-to-Month Agreements & Cancellation</h2>
          <p>
            All monthly optimization retainer agreements operate on a month-to-month basis with <strong>no long-term lock-in contracts</strong> unless otherwise agreed in writing.
          </p>
          <p>
            Either party may cancel monthly optimization services at any time by providing written email notice at least 5 business days prior to the start of the next billing cycle.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Fees & Invoicing</h2>
          <p>
            All prices quoted on the website or in formal proposals are in <strong>New Zealand Dollars (NZD)</strong>. Invoices are issued electronically and are payable within the timeframe stated on the invoice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by New Zealand law, Sinchi shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages (including loss of business profits or data) arising from search algorithm updates, competitor actions, or third-party platform policy modifications (including Google account actions).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>8. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of New Zealand. Any disputes arising in connection with these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the New Zealand courts.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>9. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding these Terms, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:hello@sinchi.co.nz">hello@sinchi.co.nz</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-card {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .legal-list strong {
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }
</style>
